                        "entry_id": "7d5b2235-98fa-30b7-9207-581bd48f1122",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The oldest person whose age is recorded in the Hebrew Bible, having reportedly lived 969 years."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9068c2a8-346d-39f3-86c5-17a74716b051",
                        "entry_id": "7d5b2235-98fa-30b7-9207-581bd48f1122",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A planet in PSR B1620-26 star system, Messier 4 globular cluster, Milky Way Galaxy, Scorpius constellation; a circumbinary planet, officially named PSR B1620-26 b, orbiting a pulsar (“PSR B1620-26 A”) and white dwarf (“WD B1620-26 B”)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
